// The invariants of `gopp fmt` (see roundtrip.test) on the Go standard library
// and its test data ($(go env GOROOT)/src, read at run time, ~7300 files), and
// the comparison with gofmt: byte-identical except for the known classes
// (doc comment reformatting, //go:build lines, non-idempotent gofmt, files that
// use Go++ keywords as names).

// It runs in four shards (goroot.long, goroot-1.long, goroot-2.long,
// goroot-3.long): the files whose place in the sorted list is K modulo 4,
// so the four run side by side; together they are the whole tree.

// REQUIRES: long
// REQUIRES: go

// RUN: %python %S/check-corpus.py %gopp --goroot --jobs 16 --min 1750 --shard 0/4
// RUN: %python %S/compare-gofmt.py %gopp --goroot --jobs 16 --shard 0/4
